<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>SparkPreneurs — Design System</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Baloo+2:wght@500;600;700;800&family=Work+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    /* ===== COLOR TOKENS ===== */
    --ink-navy: #1B2A4A;
    --ink-navy-soft: #2E4270;
    --spark-yellow: #FFC93C;
    --spark-yellow-deep: #E8AC12;
    --clay-coral: #FF6B57;
    --clay-coral-deep: #E5503C;
    --moss-green: #3F9C6D;
    --moss-green-deep: #2E7A54;
    --paper-cream: #FBF7EF;
    --paper-cream-alt: #F3EDE0;
    --slate: #64748B;
    --slate-light: #94A3B8;
    --white: #FFFFFF;

    /* ===== TYPE TOKENS ===== */
    --font-display: 'Baloo 2', sans-serif;
    --font-body: 'Work Sans', sans-serif;
    --font-mono: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;

    /* ===== RADIUS / SHADOW ===== */
    --radius-card: 16px;
    --radius-btn: 10px;
    --radius-tag: 100px;
    --shadow-card: 0 4px 14px rgba(27, 42, 74, 0.08);
    --shadow-card-hover: 0 10px 24px rgba(27, 42, 74, 0.14);
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--paper-cream);
    color: var(--ink-navy);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .wrap { max-width: 1040px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 64px 24px 120px; }

  header.intro {
    margin-bottom: 72px;
  }
  header.intro .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--clay-coral-deep);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  header.intro h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 46px;
    margin: 10px 0 12px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  header.intro p {
    color: var(--slate);
    font-size: 17px;
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  section { margin-bottom: 72px; }
  section > h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 26px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 6px;
  }
  section > .section-note {
    color: var(--slate);
    font-size: 14px;
    margin: 0 0 28px;
  }

  /* ===== COLOR SWATCHES ===== */
  .swatch-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(150px, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .swatch {
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
    background: var(--white);
  }
  .swatch .fill { height: 84px; }
  .swatch .label {
    padding: 12px 14px 14px;
  }
  .swatch .name {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .swatch .hex {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--slate);
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  /* ===== TYPE SCALE ===== */
  .type-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 20px;
    padding: 18px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--paper-cream-alt);
  }
  .type-row:first-child { padding-top: 0; }
  .type-meta {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--slate);
    width: 150px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .type-sample.display { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; }
  .type-sample.body { font-family: var(--font-body); font-weight: 500; }

  /* ===== BUTTONS ===== */
  .btn-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px; align-items: center; }
  .btn {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 15px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-btn);
    padding: 13px 24px;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
  }
  .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--spark-yellow);
    color: var(--ink-navy);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 0 var(--spark-yellow-deep);
  }
  .btn-primary:hover { box-shadow: 0 6px 0 var(--spark-yellow-deep); }
  .btn-secondary {
    background: var(--ink-navy);
    color: var(--white);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #0F1A30;
  }
  .btn-secondary:hover { box-shadow: 0 6px 0 #0F1A30; }
  .btn-ghost {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--ink-navy);
    border: 2px solid var(--ink-navy);
    padding: 11px 22px;
  }
  .btn-ghost:hover { background: var(--ink-navy); color: var(--white); }
  .btn-coral {
    background: var(--clay-coral);
    color: var(--white);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 0 var(--clay-coral-deep);
  }

  /* ===== TAGS ===== */
  .tag-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; }
  .tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-tag);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }
  .tag-navy { background: rgba(27,42,74,0.1); color: var(--ink-navy); }
  .tag-coral { background: rgba(255,107,87,0.14); color: var(--clay-coral-deep); }
  .tag-green { background: rgba(63,156,109,0.14); color: var(--moss-green-deep); }
  .tag-yellow { background: rgba(255,201,60,0.22); color: #8A6A0C; }

  /* ===== CARDS ===== */
  .card-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
  }
  .prog-card {
    background: var(--white);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: box-shadow 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .prog-card:hover {
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card-hover);
    transform: translateY(-3px);
  }
  .prog-card .stripe { height: 6px; }
  .stripe.coral { background: var(--clay-coral); }
  .stripe.navy { background: var(--ink-navy); }
  .stripe.green { background: var(--moss-green); }
  .stripe.yellow { background: var(--spark-yellow); }
  .prog-card .photo {
    height: 130px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--white);
  }
  .photo.coral-bg { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--clay-coral), var(--clay-coral-deep)); }
  .photo.navy-bg { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--ink-navy-soft), var(--ink-navy)); }
  .photo.green-bg { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--moss-green), var(--moss-green-deep)); }
  .photo.yellow-bg { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--spark-yellow), var(--spark-yellow-deep)); color: var(--ink-navy); }
  .prog-card .body { padding: 18px; }
  .prog-card h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 18px;
    margin: 0 0 6px;
  }
  .prog-card p {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: var(--slate);
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }
  .prog-card .meta-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .prog-card .price {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--ink-navy);
  }

  /* ===== SPACING SCALE ===== */
  .space-row { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 18px; }
  .space-block { background: var(--clay-coral); border-radius: 4px; }
  .space-item { text-align: center; }
  .space-item .num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--slate);
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  footer.note {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--paper-cream-alt);
    padding-top: 24px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--slate-light);
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

  <header class="intro">
    <div class="eyebrow">Design System · v1</div>
    <h1>SparkPreneurs</h1>
    <p>A warm, hands-on identity for a kids' activities business — energetic enough for the classroom, calm enough for a parent reading on their phone at 9pm.</p>
  </header>

  <section>
    <h2>Color</h2>
    <p class="section-note">Ink Navy anchors trust and text. Spark Yellow is the one true accent — used for calls to action, sparingly. Clay Coral and Moss Green key into program categories. Paper Cream is the page, never pure white or gray.</p>
    <div class="swatch-grid">
      <div class="swatch"><div class="fill" style="background:var(--ink-navy)"></div><div class="label"><div class="name">Ink Navy</div><div class="hex">#1B2A4A</div></div></div>
      <div class="swatch"><div class="fill" style="background:var(--spark-yellow)"></div><div class="label"><div class="name">Spark Yellow</div><div class="hex">#FFC93C</div></div></div>
      <div class="swatch"><div class="fill" style="background:var(--clay-coral)"></div><div class="label"><div class="name">Clay Coral</div><div class="hex">#FF6B57</div></div></div>
      <div class="swatch"><div class="fill" style="background:var(--moss-green)"></div><div class="label"><div class="name">Moss Green</div><div class="hex">#3F9C6D</div></div></div>
      <div class="swatch"><div class="fill" style="background:var(--paper-cream-alt)"></div><div class="label"><div class="name">Paper Cream</div><div class="hex">#FBF7EF</div></div></div>
      <div class="swatch"><div class="fill" style="background:var(--slate)"></div><div class="label"><div class="name">Slate</div><div class="hex">#64748B</div></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Type</h2>
    <p class="section-note">Baloo 2 for anything a kid or parent should feel invited by — headlines, nav, card titles. Work Sans for anything that needs to be read carefully. IBM Plex Mono for prices, ages, and schedule details — it reads like a supply label, not a paragraph.</p>

    <div class="type-row">
      <div class="type-meta">Display / 46px / 800</div>
      <div class="type-sample display" style="font-size:46px;">Let's build something.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="type-row">
      <div class="type-meta">H2 / 30px / 700</div>
      <div class="type-sample display" style="font-size:30px;">Pottery Wheel Basics</div>
    </div>
    <div class="type-row">
      <div class="type-meta">H3 / 20px / 600</div>
      <div class="type-sample display" style="font-size:20px; font-weight:600;">Ages 6–9 · Saturdays</div>
    </div>
    <div class="type-row">
      <div class="type-meta">Body / 16px / 500</div>
      <div class="type-sample body" style="font-size:16px;">Kids learn to center clay on the wheel and shape their first bowl, no experience needed.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="type-row">
      <div class="type-meta">Small / 13px / 400</div>
      <div class="type-sample body" style="font-size:13px; color:var(--slate);">All materials included. Aprons provided.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="type-row">
      <div class="type-meta">Mono / 13px / 600</div>
      <div class="type-sample" style="font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:13px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:0.02em;">$189 · 6 SESSIONS · AGES 6–9</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Buttons</h2>
    <p class="section-note">Primary is Spark Yellow — reserve it for the one action per screen you actually want taken (Register, Book Now). Secondary (navy) for lower-stakes actions. Ghost for tertiary/nav-level links. The offset shadow gives a tactile, "press it" feel without needing animation.</p>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <button class="btn btn-primary">Register Now</button>
      <button class="btn btn-secondary">View Schedule</button>
      <button class="btn btn-coral">Book an Event</button>
      <button class="btn btn-ghost">Learn More</button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Tags</h2>
    <p class="section-note">Small mono-set pills for metadata — age range, format, category. Color-matched to the program's stripe color so the same signal repeats across the site.</p>
    <div class="tag-row">
      <span class="tag tag-navy">AGES 8–12</span>
      <span class="tag tag-coral">POTTERY</span>
      <span class="tag tag-green">YOGA & MOVEMENT</span>
      <span class="tag tag-yellow">SUMMER CAMP</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Program Cards</h2>
    <p class="section-note">The signature element: a colored top-edge stripe keyed to category, consistent everywhere a program appears — homepage grid, program page header, register directory. Parents learn the color code without ever being told it exists.</p>
    <div class="card-grid">
      <div class="prog-card">
        <div class="stripe coral"></div>
        <div class="photo coral-bg">Pottery Wheel</div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Pottery — Wheel</h3>
          <p>Hands-on wheel throwing for first-timers and returning artists.</p>
          <div class="meta-row">
            <span class="price">$189</span>
            <span class="tag tag-coral">AGES 6–9</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="prog-card">
        <div class="stripe navy"></div>
        <div class="photo navy-bg">Robotics Lab</div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Robotics Lab</h3>
          <p>Build and code a working robot over six weeks.</p>
          <div class="meta-row">
            <span class="price">$210</span>
            <span class="tag tag-navy">AGES 9–13</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="prog-card">
        <div class="stripe green"></div>
        <div class="photo green-bg">Yoga & Gymnastics</div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Yoga & Gymnastics</h3>
          <p>Balance, flexibility, and focus through movement play.</p>
          <div class="meta-row">
            <span class="price">$150</span>
            <span class="tag tag-green">AGES 4–7</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="prog-card">
        <div class="stripe yellow"></div>
        <div class="photo yellow-bg">Summer Camp</div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Summer Camp</h3>
          <p>A full week mixing art, science, and outdoor play.</p>
          <div class="meta-row">
            <span class="price">$320/wk</span>
            <span class="tag tag-yellow">AGES 6–12</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Spacing</h2>
    <p class="section-note">An 8px base scale keeps every margin/padding decision predictable instead of ad-hoc.</p>
    <div class="space-row">
      <div class="space-item"><div class="space-block" style="width:8px; height:8px;"></div><div class="num">4</div></div>
      <div class="space-item"><div class="space-block" style="width:16px; height:16px;"></div><div class="num">8</div></div>
      <div class="space-item"><div class="space-block" style="width:24px; height:24px;"></div><div class="num">16</div></div>
      <div class="space-item"><div class="space-block" style="width:32px; height:32px;"></div><div class="num">24</div></div>
      <div class="space-item"><div class="space-block" style="width:48px; height:48px;"></div><div class="num">32</div></div>
      <div class="space-item"><div class="space-block" style="width:64px; height:64px;"></div><div class="num">48</div></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer class="note">
    Fonts loaded via Google Fonts CDN (free, no license cost). All tokens above are defined as CSS custom properties in <code>:root</code>.
  </footer>

</div>
</body>
</html>
